title: Earthquake in ERC, Republicans walk out!
view-if: player_party = "erc" and erc_core_dissent >= 55 and not erc_core_resign
tags: event
role: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/erc/disunity.jpeg
on-arrival: erc_split_faction = "core"
call: erc_faction_split_effect

= The Republican Core walks out

After months of voicing out their disagreements, lately so even publicly, the very heart of our party, the Republican core, has resigned en masse. The faction representing a strive for democratization, public accountability, a new way of doing things, the very "R" of ERC has, now definitely, given up on us and the direction the party has taken. 

- @post_event: We must carry on
